void mystery(int *ptra, int *ptrb) { 
 int *temp; 
 temp = ptrb; 
 ptrb = ptra; 
 ptra = temp; 
 } 
Important: 
 Pointers are passed by value. 
 So only local copies are swapped. 
 Actual variables are NOT modified. 
 Now trace main. 
Initial: 
 a = 2016 
 b = 0 
 c = 4 
 d = 42 
 Call: 
  mystery(&a, &b); 
No effect on a or b. 
 Condition: 
  if (a < c) 
2016 < 4 → false 
 So this mystery call is skipped. 
Next: 
  mystery(&a, &d); 
Again no effect. 
So a remains 2016. 
